{"ticker":{"symbol":"AFCG","name":"Advanced Flower Capital Inc.","market":"US","exchange":""},"currency":"USD","price":3.04,"change_pct":0.01672240802675584,"market_cap":68305016.0,"pe":16.0,"pb":0.36830628,"dividend_yield":0.06578947368421052,"week52_low":2.06,"week52_high":3.84,"sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Asset Management","country":"United States","city":"West Palm Beach","employees":null,"website":"https://advancedflowercapital.com","business_summary":"Advanced Flower Capital Inc. originates, structures, underwrites, invests in, and manages senior secured loans and other types of mortgage loans and debt securities for established companies operating in the cannabis industry. It primarily originates loans structured as senior loans secured by real estate, equipment, cash flows, and licenses and/or other assets of the loan parties to the extent permitted by applicable laws and the regulations governing such loan parties. The company was formerly known as AFC Gamma, Inc. and changed its name to Advanced Flower Capital Inc. in October 2024. Advanced Flower Capital Inc. was incorporated in 2020 and is based in West Palm Beach, Florida.","business_summary_ko":"Advanced Flower Capital Inc.는 대마초 업계에서 운영되는 기존 회사를 위한 선순위 담보 대출 및 기타 유형의 모기지 대출 및 채무 증권을 창안, 구성, 인수, 투자 및 관리합니다. 이는 주로 해당 법률 및 해당 대출 당사자를 규율하는 규정에서 허용하는 한도 내에서 부동산, 장비, 현금 흐름, 라이센스 및/또는 대출 당사자의 기타 자산을 담보로 하는 선순위 대출 구조의 대출입니다. 이 회사는 이전에 AFC Gamma, Inc.로 알려졌으며 2024년 10월에 Advanced Flower Capital Inc.로 이름을 변경했습니다. Advanced Flower Capital Inc.는 2020년에 설립되었으며 플로리다주 웨스트팜비치에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":29367500.0,"rev_lo":29294000.0,"rev_hi":29441000.0,"rev_g":0.19559999,"n":2,"eps":null,"eps_lo":null,"eps_hi":null,"eps_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":29448500.0,"rev_lo":28000000.0,"rev_hi":30897000.0,"rev_g":0.0028,"n":2,"eps":0.71,"eps_lo":0.68,"eps_hi":0.74,"eps_g":0.0519}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"자산운용","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":55776297.